Package: gunplotR
Type: Package
Title: Plot from R with Gunplot or Gnuplot
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Zhou", family = "Shirong", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zsrnog@yeah.net")
    )
Author: Zhou Shirong
Maintainer: Zhou Shirong <zsrnog@yeah.net>
Description: A lightweight wrapper for calling an external Gunplot or
    Gnuplot executable from R. It can run plotting scripts and provides
    R-friendly helpers for 2D, 3D, and 4D plots, including surfaces, pm3d
    maps, palette-colored point clouds, contours, vectors, polygons, voxels,
    and isosurfaces.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/zsrnog/gunplotR
BugReports: https://github.com/zsrnog/gunplotR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
